// Example fleeting note — shows the recording format. Delete once you have your
// own captures (or once this one has been processed into the model).
fleeting example_idea {
  captured = "2026-06-23"
  tags     = ["example", "triage"]
  note = <<NOTE
    A wskill could grow a `decision` unit type — a short record of a choice made and
    why, so the reasoning survives. Not sure if it is its own unit or just a concept.
    Look at how ADRs (architecture decision records) structure this before deciding.
  NOTE
}
